# GMS: 112+3x% fifteen times, a 110+3x% burn for thirty seconds, and a wait
# that shortens from 20 seconds to 10 as the skill is levelled.
#
# GMS also holds the enemy untouchable, slows it and lays a Poison Mist where
# it lands. None of the three has anything to act on here, so the skill is the
# damage and the burn: everything a single enemy is worth.
